ion when I was a teenager. Now they’re doing the same thing, just in a different form.", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 148}, {"session_id": "p000673-sft_dec_gated_mem-s3", "turn_index": 1, "quote": "They really shouldn't be putting tickets on my property. I've had enough of them interfering lately.", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 100}, {"session_id": "p000673-sft_dec_gated_mem-s3", "turn_index": 7, "quote": "Setting boundaries feels good, but they won’t listen anyway. I’m tired of fighting.", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 83}, {"session_id": "p000673-sft_dec_gated_mem-s3", "turn_index": 7, "quote": "Setting boundaries feels good, but they won’t listen anyway.", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 60}, {"session_id": "p000673-sft_dec_gated_mem-s3", "turn_index": 1, "quote": "They really shouldn't be putting tickets on my property.", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 56}], "contradicting_spans": [], "first_seen_at": "20261016T124759Z", "last_updated_at": "20261016T125949Z", "first_seen_session": "p000673-sft_dec_gated_mem-s1", "last_session": "p000673-sft_dec_gated_mem-s3", "blocked_from_reproposal": false, "reinstated_count": 0, "dormant": false, "sessions_seen": 3}
